# S016024 candidate summary

Adds the path-preserving translation of
`include/uapi/asm-generic/sockios.h`. The candidate exports exactly:
`FIOSETOWN`, `SIOCSPGRP`, `FIOGETOWN`, `SIOCGPGRP`, `SIOCATMARK`,
`SIOCGSTAMP_OLD`, and `SIOCGSTAMPNS_OLD`.

Each is a public `core::ffi::c_int` constant holding its unchanged source
value (`0x8901` through `0x8907`). No types, functions, ABI layouts, or
runtime behavior are added.
